 "remarks": "Tucked on a quiet street just blocks from downtown Stamford's restaurants, bars, shops, and parks - this renovated one-floor condo delivers easy living in an unbeatable location. The primary suite impresses with a bay window, full ensuite bath, and spacious walk-in closet. A second ensuite bedroom opens through sliders to its own private space. The open dining room flows seamlessly into the kitchen, while a hallway laundry closet keeps day-to-day living effortless. Thoughtfully maintained throughout - this is one-floor living done right.",
